  id: tur_1_gozlem
  prompt: "Usta defterini a\xE7madan \xF6nce masaya \xFC\xE7 g\xF6zlem kart\u0131
    b\u0131rakt\u0131. Her g\xF6zlem hangi tepkime t\xFCr\xFCn\xFCn kan\u0131t\u0131?"
  hint: "\xC7e\u015Fmeyi, k\xF6pr\xFCy\xFC ve feneri hat\u0131rla: neler birle\u015Fti,
    ne ayr\u0131ld\u0131, ne yand\u0131?"
  boxes:
  - Sentez
  - Analiz
  - Yanma
  cards:
  - reaction: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\xC7e\u015Fme: iki gaz kazanda birle\u015Fti, tek \xFCr\xFCn oldu."
    box: 0
  - reaction: {fileID: 0}
    text: "K\xF6pr\xFC: kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131 \u0131s\u0131t\u0131ld\u0131, iki
      maddeye ayr\u0131ld\u0131."
    box: 1
  - reaction: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Fener: yak\u0131t oksijenle birle\u015Fti, \u0131s\u0131 ve \u0131\u015F\u0131k
      \xE7\u0131kt\u0131."
    box: 2
